WEBVTT

00:00:01.347 --> 00:00:03.627
But if you lose,

00:00:03.707 --> 00:00:06.147
you will leave Monsters University.

00:00:06.907 --> 00:00:08.347
(CROWD MURMURING)

00:00:09.987 --> 00:00:11.427
Deal.

00:00:11.507 --> 00:00:15.067
Now all you need to do is find
enough members to compete.

00:00:15.147 --> 00:00:16.147
We need six guys, right?

00:00:16.227 --> 00:00:17.267
MALE ANNOUNCER: Sorry, chief.

00:00:17.507 --> 00:00:20.867
We count bodies, not heads.
That dude counts as one.

00:00:20.947 --> 00:00:22.027
(CROWD LAUGHING)

00:00:22.427 --> 00:00:24.587
Anybody else want to join our team?
Anyone at all?

00:00:24.667 --> 00:00:25.787
Excuse me. Sorry. I'm late.

00:00:26.067 --> 00:00:27.267
-Can I squeeze by you?
-Randy!

00:00:27.347 --> 00:00:29.147
Randy, thank goodness.
I need you on my team.

00:00:29.427 --> 00:00:32.027
Oh. Sorry. I'm already on a team.

00:00:32.107 --> 00:00:33.107
Boggs.

00:00:33.187 --> 00:00:35.427
I'm finally in with the cool kids, Mike.

00:00:35.507 --> 00:00:37.107
Don't blow this for me.

00:00:38.707 --> 00:00:39.747
Do the thing.

00:00:40.227 --> 00:00:42.027
-Oh! Where did he go?
-(ALL LAUGH)

00:00:42.347 --> 00:00:43.347
Please, anybody.

00:00:43.427 --> 00:00:45.587
I need one more monster.
Just one more!

00:00:46.027 --> 00:00:47.667
Yeah, sorry. Doesn't look good.

00:00:47.747 --> 00:00:50.227
We have to move on.
Your team doesn't qualify.

00:00:50.307 --> 00:00:51.627
Yes, it does!

00:00:52.947 --> 00:00:55.027
The star player has just arrived.

00:00:55.547 --> 00:00:58.147
No way! Someone else!
Please! Anyone else.

00:00:58.547 --> 00:01:01.027
We're shutting down sign-ups, okay?
Is he on your team or not?

00:01:03.747 --> 00:01:05.107
FEMALE MONSTER:
Come on! Let's go!

00:01:05.427 --> 00:01:06.667
(GRUNTING)

00:01:07.347 --> 00:01:08.907
Fine! Yes, he's on my team.

00:01:09.507 --> 00:01:10.547
Good luck.

00:01:13.707 --> 00:01:16.107
All right, Wazowski, what's the plan?

00:01:21.347 --> 00:01:23.267
This is a fraternity house?

00:01:23.347 --> 00:01:27.067
Hey there, teammateys!
Come on aboard!

00:01:28.027 --> 00:01:30.107
As the president of Oozma Kappa,

00:01:30.187 --> 00:01:32.907
it is my honor to welcome you
to your new home.

00:01:34.387 --> 00:01:36.467
We call this room "Party Central."

00:01:36.747 --> 00:01:38.907
Technically, we haven't
actually had a party here yet.

00:01:38.987 --> 00:01:41.347
But when we do, we'll be ready!

00:01:47.507 --> 00:01:48.547
Whoo!

00:01:48.627 --> 00:01:52.107
The hot cocoa train
is coming through! Whoa!

00:01:52.187 --> 00:01:54.027
-Next stop... You!
-(CUPS RATTLING)

00:01:54.107 --> 00:01:56.107
I would like to start us off first by...

00:01:56.467 --> 00:01:58.547
So, you guys are Scaring majors?

00:01:58.947 --> 00:02:01.947
(CHUCKLES) We were!
None of us lasted very long.

00:02:02.027 --> 00:02:05.387
I guess we just weren't what
old Hardscrabble was looking for.

00:02:05.467 --> 00:02:08.347
Don Carlton, mature student.

00:02:08.427 --> 00:02:10.707
Thirty years in the textile industry

00:02:10.867 --> 00:02:12.947
and then old dandy Don got downsized.

00:02:13.027 --> 00:02:14.867
Figured I could throw myself a pity party,

00:02:14.947 --> 00:02:16.987
or go back to school
and learn the computers.

00:02:17.787 --> 00:02:18.987
Hello. I'm Terry with a "Y"...

00:02:19.067 --> 00:02:22.027
And I'm Terri with an "I"!
I'm a dance major!

00:02:22.107 --> 00:02:23.267
(CHUCKLES) And I'm not.

00:02:23.347 --> 00:02:25.267
Five, six, seven, eight! (SCATTING)

00:02:25.347 --> 00:02:27.747
Seven, eight, turn! And...
Why didn't you turn?

00:02:27.827 --> 00:02:29.627
Because we never agreed to do this!

00:02:29.907 --> 00:02:32.387
-You said this was going to be cool!
-No one said this was gonna be cool.

00:02:32.467 --> 00:02:33.707
-Now I'm embarrassed.
-Now you're embarrassed?

00:02:33.787 --> 00:02:35.147
Yes, because it's in front of people!

00:02:35.227 --> 00:02:36.627
You should wake up embarrassed.

00:02:36.707 --> 00:02:37.827
Hey, hey, hey!

00:02:38.307 --> 00:02:41.147
I'm Art! New Age philosophy major.

00:02:41.227 --> 00:02:43.467
Excited to live with you
and laugh with you,

00:02:44.467 --> 00:02:45.827
and cry with you.

00:02:47.467 --> 00:02:49.667
Thought you might like
to keep a dream journal.

00:02:51.907 --> 00:02:53.107
-Guess that leaves me.
-Ah!

00:02:53.187 --> 00:02:54.667
My name's Scott Squibbles.

00:02:54.747 --> 00:02:56.307
My friends call me Squishy.

00:02:56.387 --> 00:02:58.547
I'm undeclared, unattached,

00:02:58.627 --> 00:03:02.307
and unwelcome pretty much
everywhere but here.

00:03:02.747 --> 00:03:04.987
Now that we've all been introduced,
as captain of our team...

00:03:05.067 --> 00:03:07.667
So, basically, you guys have
no Scaring experience?

00:03:08.027 --> 00:03:10.747
(CHUCKLES) Not a lot!
But now we've got you!

00:03:10.947 --> 00:03:13.307
You're about the scariest fella
I've ever seen.

00:03:13.387 --> 00:03:14.947
Even with them pink polka dots.

00:03:15.067 --> 00:03:16.147
Aw, thanks.

00:03:16.747 --> 00:03:18.467
Actually, I think I bring
the whole package.

00:03:18.667 --> 00:03:20.027
Your hands are as big as my face!

00:03:20.347 --> 00:03:21.587
He's like a mountain with fur!

00:03:22.027 --> 00:03:24.027
Oh, come on. I don't even work out.

00:03:24.227 --> 00:03:27.507
Yeah, me neither.
I don't want to get too big. (SNIFFS)

00:03:28.347 --> 00:03:31.347
We thought our dreams were over,
but Mike said if we win,

00:03:31.427 --> 00:03:32.907
they're letting us in the Scaring program.

00:03:33.187 --> 00:03:35.027
We're going to be real Scarers!

00:03:35.307 --> 00:03:36.987
-The best!
-You betcha! (CHUCKLES)

00:03:37.067 --> 00:03:38.707
Yeah! (CHUCKLES) Right.

00:03:41.027 --> 00:03:43.547
And here's what you've been
waiting for, fellas.

00:03:43.627 --> 00:03:45.787
Your very own Oozma Kappa bedroom.

00:03:46.787 --> 00:03:50.027
Oh... Great! We're sharing this room?

00:03:50.147 --> 00:03:51.827
We'll let you guys get settled.

00:03:51.907 --> 00:03:54.347
Anything you need,
you just give a big holler-oonie!

00:03:54.427 --> 00:03:57.347
Okay, thanks, buddy.
Are you kidding me?

00:03:57.587 --> 00:03:59.987
Look, they don't need to be good.
I'm going to carry the whole team.

00:04:00.267 --> 00:04:02.387
Really? And who's going to carry you?

00:04:02.787 --> 00:04:04.227
Hey, if you want to go back
to can design,

00:04:04.307 --> 00:04:05.547
you know where the door is.

00:04:06.707 --> 00:04:08.147
(FLICKING LIGHT SWITCH)

00:04:08.227 --> 00:04:09.467
Great.

00:04:11.867 --> 00:04:12.947
Guys?

00:04:13.947 --> 00:04:15.267
Anybody home?

00:04:16.947 --> 00:04:18.347
(CREAKING)

00:04:21.547 --> 00:04:22.587
Um...

00:04:22.667 --> 00:04:24.027
(STAMMERS) Hello?

00:04:24.787 --> 00:04:25.867
Fellas?

00:04:31.947 --> 00:04:34.707
Do you pledge your souls

00:04:34.787 --> 00:04:36.587
to the Oozma Kappa brotherhood?

00:04:36.787 --> 00:04:38.107
-Ow!
-Do you swear to

00:04:38.187 --> 00:04:40.387
-keep secret...
-...all that you learn here?

00:04:40.467 --> 00:04:43.267
No matter how horrifying?

00:04:43.427 --> 00:04:44.627
Hey!

00:04:44.947 --> 00:04:46.907
Will you take the sacred oath
of the... (GASPS)

00:04:47.027 --> 00:04:48.987
-For crying out loud.
-Sweetie!

00:04:49.067 --> 00:04:50.947
Turn the lights on
while you're down here!

00:04:51.027 --> 00:04:52.507
You're going to ruin your eyes!

00:04:52.947 --> 00:04:55.507
Mom! We're doing an initiation!

00:04:55.867 --> 00:04:58.667
Oh, scary. Well, carry on.

00:04:58.747 --> 00:05:00.707
Just pretend I'm not here.

00:05:00.787 --> 00:05:01.907
This is my mom's house.

00:05:03.707 --> 00:05:05.707
Do you promise to look out
for your brothers...

00:05:05.787 --> 00:05:07.027
(DIAL CRANKING)

00:05:08.347 --> 00:05:10.107
...no matter what the peril?

00:05:10.227 --> 00:05:11.667
(WASHING MACHINE WHIRRING)

00:05:12.547 --> 00:05:16.507
Will you defend Oozma Kappa
no matter how dangerous?

00:05:16.587 --> 00:05:19.987
No matter how insurmountable
the odds may be?

00:05:20.067 --> 00:05:22.667
From evils both great and small?

00:05:22.747 --> 00:05:24.987
In the face of unending pain and...

00:05:25.827 --> 00:05:28.507
Oh, forget it! You're in.

00:05:28.827 --> 00:05:30.627
Look, we know
we're no one's first choice

00:05:30.707 --> 00:05:31.907
for a fraternity,

00:05:31.987 --> 00:05:34.227
so it means a lot
to have you here with us.

00:05:34.307 --> 00:05:38.187
Can't wait to start Scaring
with you, brothers.

00:05:41.827 --> 00:05:42.987
(SIGHS)

00:05:43.987 --> 00:05:45.267
(ALL CHEERING)

00:05:47.347 --> 00:05:49.067
-Time for a celebration!
-Yeah!

00:05:49.347 --> 00:05:51.067
Grab the couch cushions, gentlemen,

00:05:51.187 --> 00:05:52.827
because we're building a fort!

00:05:54.507 --> 00:05:56.467
Mom, can we stay up late tonight?

00:06:03.347 --> 00:06:04.787
(MIKE AND SULLEY SNORING)

